      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What I want most out of this feature is to be able to play games in quest-compatible worlds without screaming kids interrupting it. So, I would prefer if this wasn't a world-based toggle, but more so an instance-based toggle. \n\ne.g. there would be multiple lobbies of the game Murder, some normal and some 18+, only accounts with the 18+ verification would be able to play in those lobbies.\n\nOf course, this would also add the benefit of creating events that are 18+, like drinking, clubbing, etc.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
